DESCRIPTION:🦷 Launch Your Career with ICO Dental Group – Info Session\n📅
  Thursday\, May 28\, 2026🕛 12:00 PM – 1:00 PM💻 Virtual (Zoom link provi
 ded upon registration)\nLooking for a career where you can grow fast\, ea
 rn\, and make an impact—regardless of your major? Join ICO Dental Group f
 or a virtual info session and learn about exciting Sales Representative o
 pportunities with a rapidly expanding national company.\nHeadquartered in
  Princeton\, NJ\, ICO Dental Group serves 3\,000+ clients across 40+ stat
 es and operates offices nationwide. Their mission is to elevate U.S. dent
 istry by combining innovative technology\, strong local partnerships\, an
 d cost-effective solutions.\n💼 Why Attend?\n\nLearn about paid internshi
 p roles (open to all majors!)\nExplore career growth in a fast-growing\, 
 multi-state organization\nUnderstand how ICO blends technology\, business
 \, and healthcare\nGet insider tips on the hiring process and what they l
 ook for in candidates\nAsk questions directly to the ICO team\n\n🌍 Who S
 hould Attend?\n\nStudents from any major interested in business\, sales\,
  or client-facing roles\nStudents seeking career growth and leadership op
 portunities\nInternational students — ICO offers sponsorship opportunitie
 s\n\n✨ Whether you're exploring options or ready to launch your career\, 
 this is a great chance to connect with a company that’s growing nationwid
 e and investing in early talent.\n👉 Don’t miss out—register now and lear
 n how you can get started with ICO Dental Group!\nhttps://montclair.joinh
 andshake.com/events/1951243/share_preview\n\nHosted by: The Office for Ex
 periential Education and Career Connections\n\nOnline Location: https://m
 ontclair.zoom.us/j/97737735001?pwd=h8l4JfTGl3wt0SKD1h7pZr6KbnFERE.1&jst=2
 \n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.
 com/engage/event/12462491
